<title>USA: ValuJet to release advisory - sources.</title>
<headline>ValuJet to release advisory - sources.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>ValuJet Inc was preparing on Thursday to release a special advisory to the financial press, company sources said.</p>
<p>The sources did not say what issues the advisory would address.  But news of the impending announcement surfaced as a lawmaker's office in Washington said the U.S. Department of Transportation had given the grounded discount carrier final clearance to resume flight service.</p>
<p>ValuJet stock was up 2-1/4 at 12-1/2 in active Nasdaq market trading.</p>
